# Translation integration

Use installed translation types and version-matched upstream documentation. Register the required addon within the runtime boundary and validate model lifecycle, result shape and interruption. The basic chat session does not expose translation.

Select the installed app profile before using https://docs.qvac.tether.io/sdk/js-ts-sdk/ and https://docs.qvac.tether.io/sdk/reference/release-notes/.
